{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0301","text":"Мне нравится этот магазин.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0302","text":"Сколько это стоит?","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0303","text":"У нас нет этого товара.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0304","text":"Приятного аппетита!","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0305","text":"Я купил три яблока.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0306","text":"Хлеб ещё не продан.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0307","text":"Эти туфли мне малы.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0308","text":"Мне нужен стакан воды.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0309","text":"Я возьму тот же самый.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0310","text":"Счёт, пожалуйста.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0311","text":"Аппетит приходит во время еды.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0312","text":"Купи кота в мешке.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0313","text":"Голод не тётка.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0314","text":"Это маркет.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"false_friend","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0315","text":"Деликатес на любой вкус.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"false_friend","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0316","text":"Цена снижена, а качество прежнее.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0317","text":"Суп горячий, будь осторожен.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0318","text":"Мясо было жёстким.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0319","text":"Продукты свежие.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0320","text":"Официант принёс меню.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0321","text":"Кофе слишком крепкий.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0322","text":"Я заказал пиццу на вынос.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0323","text":"В магазине большой выбор.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0324","text":"Молоко прокисло.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"food","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0325","text":"Скидка действует до пятницы.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0326","text":"Он ест как птичка.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0327","text":"Нет ничего лучше домашней еды.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"food","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0328","text":"Касса находится у выхода.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0329","text":"Я плачу картой.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0330","text":"Блюдо дня — борщ со сметаной.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0331","text":"Не хлебом единым жив человек.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0332","text":"Этот ресторан популярный.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0333","text":"Фрукты продаются на развес.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0334","text":"Еда была слишком солёная.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0335","text":"Мне принесли не тот заказ.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0336","text":"Хозяйка угостила нас пирогом.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"food","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0337","text":"Магазин работает круглосуточно.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0338","text":"Это ресторан быстрого питания.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0339","text":"Покупки доставят завтра.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0340","text":"В меню есть вегетарианские блюда.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0341","text":"Кефир полезен для пищеварения.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"food","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0342","text":"Мне нравится здешняя кухня.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0343","text":"Он попросил добавку.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0344","text":"Булка зачерствела.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"food","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0345","text":"Товар оказался бракованным.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0346","text":"Рынок работает по выходным.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0347","text":"Она купила платье со скидкой.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"shopping","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0348","text":"Все столики заняты.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0349","text":"Обед обошёлся нам недорого.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0350","text":"Я оставил чаевые официанту.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"dining","license":"original","batch_index":3}
